# BOOT WITH ADDON of Hello.gba with RESET on: as the launch starts on its
# addons, the progress dialog still shows the save step's status, not
# "Loading the game" (v0.3.2: it said so before checking the save states
# and patches). The other switches' slots are erased, and its log line
# says they are off (v0.3.2: 65535, the erased slot's value).
#! settings 1=1
-w "screen ready: sd-list"
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:- -k @16:DOWN -k @20:- -k @24:DOWN -k @28:- -k @32:DOWN -k @36:-
-k @44:A -k @48:-
-w "screen ready: file-menu"
-k @8:DOWN -k @12:- -k @20:A -k @24:-
-w "BOOT WITH ADDON: reset 1, savestate 0, sleep 0, cheats 0 "
-s @0:addons.png
